  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afe46c950e4801d44beb311b827ea6c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Wizzel_ZEV_PreClash
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Style: 0
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0a8d7fc4bc8456e8ae9b7aaf71bcb65, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: chapter01.windmill.zev_duel.pre.001
    DefaultText: "굳이 싸워야 하는 건가요...?"
    EventTriggerID: 
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: chapter01.windmill.zev_duel.pre.002
    DefaultText: "어쩔 수 없습니다만, 의뢰인의 요청입니다."
    EventTriggerID: 
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0a8d7fc4bc8456e8ae9b7aaf71bcb65, type: 2}
    Emotion: 6
    LocalizationKey: chapter01.windmill.zev_duel.pre.003
    DefaultText: "굳이 의뢰라고 싸워야 할 필요는 없잖아요!"
    EventTriggerID: 
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0a8d7fc4bc8456e8ae9b7aaf71bcb65, type: 2}
    Emotion: 2
    LocalizationKey: chapter01.windmill.zev_duel.pre.004
    DefaultText: "그냥 적당히 못 찾은 척 넘어가면 되죠!"
    EventTriggerID: 
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: chapter01.windmill.zev_duel.pre.005
    DefaultText: "저희 용병단의 운영 원칙에 어긋납니다. 죄송하지만..."
    EventTriggerID: 
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0a8d7fc4bc8456e8ae9b7aaf71bcb65, type: 2}
    Emotion: 4
    LocalizationKey: chapter01.windmill.zev_duel.pre.006
    DefaultText: "그럼 싸워야겠네요."
    EventTriggerID: 
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
